mmassx (6.0.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging, reintroducing mass spectrometry analysis
    tooling to Debian under the mmassx name. The previous package,
    mmass (5.5.0-5), was maintained by the Debichem Group from 2011
    and was removed from unstable on 2019-10-18 after upstream
    development had stalled; see the original ITP, #525675, and
    https://tracker.debian.org/pkg/mmass for that history. mMassX is
    the actively maintained successor upstream, targeting Python 3.
    (TODO: file a fresh ITP against wnpp before upload and reference
    its bug number here.)

